<title>FINLAND: Finnish June PPI up 0.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish June PPI up 0.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industry's producer price index rose 0.2 percent in June year-on-year, and rose 0.3 percent month-on-month, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>		June 1997	     May 1997	 June 1996</p>
<p>Mth/Mth	+0.3 pct	     +0.2 pct	  -0.5 pct</p>
<p>Yr/Yr	  +0.2 pct	     -0.7 pct	  +0.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
